# Corsair walk cycle. Four 32x32 frames on one 128x32 strip.
#
# Contact / passing / contact / passing. The feet stay planted on row 31
# and the body rises 1px on the passing frames -- a walk raises the hips
# because the support leg straightens, so lifting the whole sprite off
# the floor instead would read as hopping (assets/experiments/car made
# the same call about its suspension).
#
# Generated from corsair.pix, then hand-polished here. This file is the
# source; corsair-walk.png is regenerated from it by render-pix-all.
name corsair-walk
size 128 32
frames 4
key c crimson-0-shadow
key C crimson-2-hilite
key g gold
key r crimson-1
key l leather-1
key b bone-2-hilite
key o outline
key B blush
key s skin
key L leather-0-shadow
key d denim-0-shadow
key D denim-1
key h denim-2-hilite
key S steel
key O bone-1
pixels
